[{"id":126059,"sender_id":612,"sender_full_name":"nLab edit announcer","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/c58b62e30f75d369349d5c08eee8f6b9?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/2-Latest-Changes/topic/hierarchy.20of.20universes/near/126059\">#23</a> Rocq doesn’t actually use the natural numbers for universe levels. It uses a model of quantifier-free Presburger arithmetic, which does not uniquely determine the natural numbers.</p>\n<p>Matthew Belmont</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/revision/diff/hierarchy+of+universes/15\">diff</a>, <a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/revision/hierarchy+of+universes/15\">v15</a>, <a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/hierarchy+of+universes\">current</a></p>","timestamp":1789902076,"subject":"hierarchy of universes","stream_id":2,"display_recipient":"Latest Changes","reactions":[]},{"id":126062,"sender_id":612,"sender_full_name":"nLab edit announcer","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/c58b62e30f75d369349d5c08eee8f6b9?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/2-Latest-Changes/topic/hierarchy.20of.20universes/near/126062\">#24</a> the same goes for Agda and Lean.</p>\n<p>Matthew Belmont</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/revision/diff/hierarchy+of+universes/15\">diff</a>, <a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/revision/hierarchy+of+universes/15\">v15</a>, <a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/hierarchy+of+universes\">current</a></p>","timestamp":1789904270,"subject":"hierarchy of universes","stream_id":2,"display_recipient":"Latest Changes","reactions":[]},{"id":126064,"sender_id":612,"sender_full_name":"nLab edit announcer","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/c58b62e30f75d369349d5c08eee8f6b9?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/2-Latest-Changes/topic/hierarchy.20of.20universes/near/126064\">#25</a> The HoTT book also admits non-standard models for the universe hierarchy, similarly to Lean, Agda, and Rocq.</p>\n<p>Matthew Belmont</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/revision/diff/hierarchy+of+universes/15\">diff</a>, <a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/revision/hierarchy+of+universes/15\">v15</a>, <a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/hierarchy+of+universes\">current</a></p>","timestamp":1789906987,"subject":"hierarchy of universes","stream_id":2,"display_recipient":"Latest Changes","reactions":[]}]